Description: Appliance UI: open the preferences from a skin, no sound dialogs
 DecksmithOS runs Mixxx without menu bar, mouse or keyboard:
  - "[App],show_preferences" (push button) opens the preferences dialog, so
    a skin can offer a settings button.
  - With DECKSMITHOS_NO_SOUND_DIALOGS set in the environment, the start-up
    dialogs about sound devices (busy, error, no output device) are skipped:
    Mixxx starts without audio and logs a warning. Without a controller (whose
    USB audio is the output) these dialogs blocked the start on a device that
    has no way to answer them.
Author: DecksmithOS
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-11-20
