     // Sound hardware setup
     // Try to open configured devices. If that fails, display dialogs
     // that allow to either retry, reconfigure devices or exit.
+    // DecksmithOS: an appliance without mouse or keyboard cannot answer these
+    // dialogs. With DECKSMITHOS_NO_SOUND_DIALOGS set, Mixxx starts without
